## Why This Is Asked
This tests practical crisis remediation for CRR failures, IAM drift, and automated recovery in a multi-account data lake.

## Key Concepts
- S3 Cross-Region Replication and troubleshooting
- IAM role trust policies and least privilege
- CloudWatch metrics/logs and alarms
- Safe rollback and data-consistency validation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Node.js: fetch and inspect CRR configuration for a bucket
const { S3Client, GetBucketReplicationConfigurationCommand } = require('@aws-sdk/client-s3');
const c = new S3Client({region:'us-east-1'});
async function inspectCRR(bucketName) {
  const cmd = new GetBucketReplicationConfigurationCommand({Bucket: bucketName});
  const config = await c.send(cmd);
  console.log('CRR Role:', config.ReplicationConfiguration.Role);
  console.log('Rules:', config.ReplicationConfiguration.Rules);
  return config;
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design multi-region, multi-account disaster recovery with auditable controls, automated failover, and safe rollback for a live telemetry stack.

## Key Concepts
- Active-passive DR patterns with RTO/RPO trade-offs
- Cross-region data flows: Kinesis replication via Lambda consumers, S3 Cross-Region Replication, OpenSearch Cross-Cluster Replication
- DNS-based failover using Route 53 Application Recovery Controller with health checks
- Infrastructure as Code-driven recovery runbooks with automated rollback capabilities
- Regular testing cadence with documented rollback procedures and audit trails

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: Cross-region Kinesis replication trigger handler
exports.handler = async (event) => {
  const records = event.Records;
  const firehoseClient = new AWS.Firehose({region: 'eu-central-1'});

  for (const record of records) {
    await firehoseClient.putRecord({
      DeliveryStreamName: 'dr-telemetry-stream',
      Record: { Data: record.kinesis.data }
    }).promise();
  }
};
```

## Why This Is Asked
Assesss ability to design cross-account governance, immutable logs, and automated remediation in large AWS footprints. The candidate should justify cross-account delivery, object locking, encryption, and monitoring.

## Key Concepts
- Centralized log sink, cross-account delivery, S3 Object Lock; AWS KMS CMK; SCPs; CloudTrail/VPC Flow Logs/Config; EventBridge/Lambda for health checks.
- Testing strategy: staging accounts, dry-run delivery, drift detection, rollback.

